# Public build-time configuration (committed on purpose – contains NO secrets).
#
# Google OAuth client ID (type "Web application") for the optional Gmail integration.
# A client ID is public by design; the client SECRET is never needed and must never be put here.
# Remove the value to build without the Gmail feature (and without any Google CSP exceptions).
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=1011442509830-58tght1iue46n63s9e3pgafgtpdgai8l.apps.googleusercontent.com
